{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Samsen879/ciecopilot-home/pulls/1638","id":4093832514,"node_id":"PR_kwDOO5D6p870Au1C","html_url":"https://github.com/Samsen879/ciecopilot-home/pull/1638","diff_url":"https://github.com/Samsen879/ciecopilot-home/pull/1638.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/Samsen879/ciecopilot-home/pull/1638.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Samsen879/ciecopilot-home/issues/1638","number":1638,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"[codex] Repair frozen 9709 holdout replay harness","user":{"login":"Samsen879","id":172257175,"node_id":"U_kgDOCkRvlw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/172257175?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879","html_url":"https://github.com/Samsen879","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"Closes #1637.\n\n## Why\n\nThe independently reviewed #1635 holdout established 242/249 final exact matches, but its deterministic reconstruction stopped on three unnormalizable rows because it compared evaluation warnings before the terminal-status policy appended `full_pass_unnormalizable`. Review also froze ten additional generalized hardening findings around truth validation, provenance, immutable writes, complete-paper membership, relocatable crops, and post-merge replay.\n\n## What changed\n\n- adds a successor-only replay runner; every #1635 input, truth, response, runner, and report remains byte-identical\n- implements all 11 frozen generalized repairs plus three review-driven enforcement guards with fail-closed diagnostics and 25 focused positive/negative tests\n- recomputes exact membership for all 30 complete papers and 249 questions from authoritative manifests\n- resolves frozen crops from an operator-supplied external root while retaining relative paths and frozen hashes\n- binds the normalized full local provider URL and the 180-second timeout across preflight, request, terminal, and resume provenance\n- replays saved raw responses only, first for the seven residuals and then for the full 249-row regression\n\n## Results\n\n- targeted replay: 7/7 source residuals reconstructed; candidate outcomes intentionally unchanged\n- full regression: 221/249 first pass, 242/249 final (97.188755%)\n- residuals: 3 normalization failures and 4 semantic/model disagreements\n- historical provider evidence: 499 attempts and 1 retry; replay provider calls: 0\n- compact reconstruction: all four #1635 compact artifacts byte-identical, with zero raw-candidate, evaluation-field, terminal-status, or final-warning mismatches\n- local inference cost: CNY 0; production/canonical/public/remote writes: 0\n\nThese results are labelled repair/regression results, never a new independent holdout.\n\n## Verification\n\n- `python3 scripts/vlm/__tests__/issue_1637_holdout_repair.test.py` — 25 passed\n- `python3 -m py_compile scripts/vlm/issue_1637_holdout_repair.py scripts/vlm/__tests__/issue_1637_holdout_repair.test.py`\n- `/home/samsen/code/ciecopilot-home/.venv/bin/python scripts/vlm/issue_1637_holdout_repair.py validate` — 30 papers / 249 questions, PASS\n- targeted and full replay commands rerun byte-identically with zero provider calls\n- JSON parsing, `git diff --check`, runner binding, reconstruction counters, and #1635 no-diff/hash checks passed\n\n\n","created_at":"2026-07-20T19:11:14Z","updated_at":"2026-07-20T19:55:39Z","closed_at":"2026-07-20T19:53:47Z","merged_at":"2026-07-20T19:53:47Z","merge_commit_sha":"f82d2adf404b25dd83b3b56672b28141c4bb4483","assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[],"requested_teams":[],"labels":[],"milestone":null,"draft":false,"commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Samsen879/ciecopilot-home/pulls/1638/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Samsen879/ciecopilot-home/pulls/1638/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Samsen879/ciecopilot-home/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Samsen879/ciecopilot-home/issues/1638/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Samsen879/ciecopilot-home/statuses/7f2382260f00385316dd52b3e0dc172e57650ab7","head":{"label":"Samsen879:task/1637-local-vlm-holdout-repair","ref":"task/1637-local-vlm-holdout-repair","sha":"7f2382260f00385316dd52b3e0dc172e57650ab7","user":{"login":"Samsen879","id":172257175,"node_id":"U_kgDOCkRvlw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/172257175?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879","html_url":"https://github.com/Samsen879","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"repo":{"id":999357095,"node_id":"R_kgDOO5D6pw","name":"ciecopilot-home","full_name":"Samsen879/ciecopilot-home","pri